---
import BaseLayout from '../../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
import Hero from '../../components/Hero.astro';
import Prose from '../../components/Prose.astro';
---

<BaseLayout
  locale="en"
  title="About — Luvita"
  description="Luvita is a software studio. We build our own products and take on select projects end to end."
  paths={{ tr: 'hakkimizda', en: 'about' }}
>
  <Hero
    eyebrow="About"
    title="An independent software studio."
    lead="We build products of our own and take on select projects end to end."
  />

  <section class="container">
    <Prose>
      <p>
        Luvita is a software studio: we build products of our own and take on
        select projects end to end. Most of our background is in banking and
        enterprise systems, and our working habits were formed there.
      </p>
      <p>
        Luvita is founder-led — every project is engineered end to end by the
        same hands that build our products. Our founder, <strong
        >Mert Yılmaz Ertuğrul</strong>, spent over a decade building banking
        systems before founding Luvita: at Türk Eximbank, at Channel Capital
        Advisors in London, and most recently at ING. Java/Spring Boot
        backend systems, cross-platform applications with Flutter, and cloud
        architectures are the studio's core competencies.
      </p>
      <p>
        Our consumer apps ship under the <strong>CosmoCrew</strong> brand —
        SliceFocus and LexiPower on the App Store, With Handlebars on the web.
        All of them are live and actively maintained. Our focus going forward
        is growing platforms of our own — starting with <strong>Umay</strong>.
      </p>
      <h2>How we work</h2>
      <ul>
        <li>
          Significant architecture decisions are written down, so the
          reasoning behind them can be traced years later.
        </li>
        <li>
          Testing and automation are set up on day one, not bolted on at the
          end.
        </li>
        <li>
          After delivery, the system stays under our care — every app we have
          shipped is proof of that.
        </li>
        <li>We state scope, timeline and risks as they are.</li>
      </ul>
    </Prose>
  </section>
</BaseLayout>
